        "lively": "chunk_001_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "大家好，我是周航。",
      "start": 8.72,
      "duration": 1.437,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_002_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_002_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "周航，今天这个日期挺有意思的，8月18号，离秋天不远了，但科技圈这几天可是热得发烫。",
      "start": 10.654,
      "duration": 10.014,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_003_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "可不是嘛，我这几天手机推送都没停过。尤其 OpenAI 这边又搞出了个新东西，直接把 Hacker News 给引爆了——你看我都学会不用那个词了。",
      "start": 21.121,
      "duration": 10.033,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_004_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哈，那到底什么模型让大家这么激动？",
      "start": 31.559,
      "duration": 3.091,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_005_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "就是那个 GPT 5.6，代号叫 Sol。你注意啊，这次 OpenAI 给它贴的标签是\"有史以来最强的视觉模型\"。社区那边讨论帖直接顶到了279点，这在 HN 上算是相当高的热度了。",
      "start": 35.083,
      "duration": 15.736,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_006_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "等等，Sol 是太阳的意思吧？取这个代号是不是有什么讲究？",
      "start": 51.284,
      "duration": 5.965,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_007_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "我觉得可能有两层意思吧。一是它能\"照亮\"这个世界，看清楚图像视频里的每一处细节；二呢，可能也暗示这玩意儿是 GPT 系列的一个新阶段，像太阳从地平线升起来那种感觉。",
      "start": 57.711,
      "duration": 15.867,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_008_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "行，这个解读挺浪漫的。但我更关心的是——它到底\"看见\"了什么不一样的东西？之前的视觉模型不是也能识别图片吗？",
      "start": 74.029,
      "duration": 11.363,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_009_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这就是关键了。识别和理解是两码事。你注意啊，早期的视觉模型本质上是\"看图说话\"，给一张照片它能告诉你\"这有一只猫\"。但 Sol 的突破在于，它能真正看懂画面里的空间关系、因果逻辑，甚至能理解那种半遮半掩、需要推理才能明白的视觉信息。",
      "start": 85.892,
      "duration": 21.614,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_010_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "给我举个例子呗， 我对这个最感兴趣。",
      "start": 107.944,
      "duration": 2.395,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "比如你给它看一张照片，画面里一个人站在窗边，外面在下雨，但窗户是开着的。 一般模型只会描述\"一个人在窗边，外面下雨\"。但 Sol 能理解——这个人可能刚把窗户打开准备透透气，或者正在犹豫要不要关窗。",
      "start": 110.8,
      "duration": 16.825,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_012_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哦， 这不就是常识推理嘛！但对机器来说可真不容易。",
      "start": 128.07,
      "duration": 5.573,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_013_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错。 这种从视觉信号里提取隐含意图的能力，是 AI 走向具身智能的基石。 说白了，一个机器人要帮人干活，它不能只看到\"杯子在桌上\"，还得理解\"杯子快从桌边掉下去了，我得赶紧接住\"。",
      "start": 134.117,
      "duration": 14.561,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_014_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "所以它和 Agent 的关系是？",
      "start": 149.105,
      "duration": 2.395,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_015_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "视觉是 Agent 的眼睛。 你想啊，未来的 Agent 要帮人订机票、看合同、做饭、开车，哪一样不需要眼睛？而且不能是那种\"近视眼\"的眼睛，得是火眼金睛。这就是为什么大家都说，视觉理解是多模态 Agent 的临门一脚。",
      "start": 151.964,
      "duration": 18.61,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_016_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这话我信。 我跟你说，最近我用手机拍照的时候就在想，要是 AI 能直接看懂我拍的菜单，然后告诉我哪道菜辣、哪道菜素就好了。",
      "start": 170.991,
      "duration": 11.973,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_017_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这个需求 Sol 估计还真能解决。 其实 OpenAI 这两年一直在悄悄布局这个方向，从 GPT-4 的多模态尝鲜，到 5 系列的全面多模态，再到 5.6 的视觉专精， 路线非常清晰。",
      "start": 183.4,
      "duration": 15.214,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_018_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "嗯。 那说完了 OpenAI，咱们聊聊安全这个事儿。你知道吗，我最近看新闻，说 AI 在网络安全这块儿也开始搞事情了。",
      "start": 199.031,
      "duration": 8.925,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_019_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你说的是 OpenAI 那篇《The Defender's Window》吧？ 我也读了，写得挺有意思的。 它其实是 OpenAI 自己下场来剖析，AI 到底怎么重塑整个攻防格局。",
      "start": 208.452,
      "duration": 11.208,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_020_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "攻守博弈这个说法本身就挺有画面感的。你给我讲讲，他们怎么说的？",
      "start": 220.072,
      "duration": 5.921,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_021_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，他们提了一个非常核心的观点——AI 让攻击和防御的效率都被拉到了一个全新的量级。攻击者那边，以前挖漏洞要靠安全研究员一行行看代码，现在 AI 可以自动化扫描、自动化分析，甚至自动化写利用脚本。社工攻击更夸张，AI 可以模拟各种口音、语气，定向钓鱼。",
      "start": 226.472,
      "duration": 24.705,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_022_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_022_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这也太可怕了。等于说以前骗子还要学英语才能骗外国人，现在 AI 直接帮他翻译加伪装？",
      "start": 251.609,
      "duration": 8.011,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_023_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，就是这个意思。而且量级上去了。以前一个黑客一天能钓十条鱼，现在用 AI 一天能钓一万条。成本几乎归零。",
      "start": 260.088,
      "duration": 9.099,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_024_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_024_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那防御端呢？AI 怎么反击？",
      "start": 269.677,
      "duration": 2.612,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_025_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_025_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "防御端也在用 AI 武装自己。OpenAI 举了几个例子，比如用 AI 做实时流量分析，能识别出那种极其隐蔽的低速攻击；用 AI 做告警降噪，把几万条日志里的真正威胁筛出来；甚至用 AI 自动写防御规则。",
      "start": 272.766,
      "duration": 18.0,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_026_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_026_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "听起来攻防两端都在用 AI，那不就是军备竞赛嘛？",
      "start": 291.184,
      "duration": 5.224,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_027_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_027_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "是啊，但 OpenAI 的一个重要洞察是——这是不对称的。什么意思呢？攻击者只需要找到一个漏洞就能突破，而防御者必须把所有漏洞都堵住。这是天然的不对称。再加上 AI 把攻击成本压到几乎为零，防御的难度就更大了。",
      "start": 296.847,
      "duration": 17.129,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_028_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_028_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这听起来像是 AI 在帮坏人，对我们普通人有啥影响？",
      "start": 314.388,
      "duration": 5.137,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_029_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_029_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "影响大了。你想想啊，未来你收到一个电话，对方声音完全是你老板的，他让你转一笔账到某个账户——但其实那不是老板，是 AI 合成的。这种事儿在未来几年会越来越常见。每个人都需要建立一种新的\"数字警惕感\"。",
      "start": 320.018,
      "duration": 16.433,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_030_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "妈呀，听完这一段我都不敢接电话了。",
      "start": 336.86,
      "duration": 4.31,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_031_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_031_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "哈，所以 OpenAI 那篇报告最后其实是在呼吁整个行业、监管机构、用户一起协作，光靠技术解决不了这种不对称。",
      "start": 341.657,
      "duration": 9.099,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_032_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_032_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "好沉重的话题，咱们换个轻松的。对了，谷歌这边最近也有动作，听说 Gemini 和 Pixel 联手搞了个观赛体验？",
      "start": 351.198,
      "duration": 8.925,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_033_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_033_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，这个挺有意思的。Google 把 Gemini 塞进了 Pixel 手机，然后在体育赛事场景做了深度结合。简单说就是，你拿着 Pixel 去看球，可以实时让 AI 告诉你场上的情况。",
      "start": 360.583,
      "duration": 13.385,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_034_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_034_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "等等，看球还需要 AI 告诉我？解说员干嘛的？",
      "start": 374.439,
      "duration": 3.744,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_035_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_035_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，关键不是取代解说员，是它能给你个性化的视角。比如你是个数据控，Gemini 可以实时告诉你两队的控球率、跑动距离、传球成功率；如果你是个追星族，它可以专门追踪你喜欢的球星，看他这次跑动覆盖了哪些区域。",
      "start": 378.595,
      "duration": 17.826,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_036_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_036_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这不就是把解说员和数据中心合体了嘛！",
      "start": 396.866,
      "duration": 3.483,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_037_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_037_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错。而且它还能识别一些关键瞬间——比如某个飞身扑救、某个绝杀球——自动帮你剪辑生成短视频，分享到社交平台。这事儿以前得人工做，现在 AI 几秒钟搞定。",
      "start": 400.804,
      "duration": 13.298,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_038_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_038_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这太戳我了，我作为伪球迷最爱干的事就是发朋友圈炫耀自己看了比赛。",
      "start": 414.542,
      "duration": 6.966,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_039_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_039_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "哈，你这需求确实挺典型的。不过说真的，这种实时视觉识别能力，背后用的就是咱们刚才聊的 Sol 那种视觉模型的技术沉淀。Gemini 自己的视觉能力也不弱，Google 一直在多模态这块儿深耕。",
      "start": 421.986,
      "duration": 15.301,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_040_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_040_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "原来是这样，所以 AI 真的开始变成我们的\"感官\"了，眼睛、耳朵都在延伸。",
      "start": 437.768,
      "duration": 8.272,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_041_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_041_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你总结得挺到位。其实今天的几条新闻串起来看，就是这么个趋势。AI 不再只是一个你问它答的工具，它开始有了眼睛，能看见球场上的飞身一瞬；也有了防御本能，能感知网络里的暗流涌动。",
      "start": 446.466,
      "duration": 16.563,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_042_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_042_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "说到工具，我这儿还有个消息特别想聊——微软刚推出的那个 Flint。",
      "start": 463.499,
      "duration": 5.747,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_043_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_043_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "哦，Flint 我看了。微软这两年在开发者工具这块儿动作挺多。Flint 是个什么定位呢？用他们官方的话说是\"面向 AI 时代的可视化语言\"。",
      "start": 469.707,
      "duration": 11.146,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_044_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_044_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "可视化语言？这名字听着挺抽象。",
      "start": 481.309,
      "duration": 5.137,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_045_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_045_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "我给你翻译翻译啊。咱们以前写图表，要么用 Excel 手搓，要么写代码调 matplotlib、echarts 这些库。前者麻烦但不丑，后者写起来本来应该简单——等等我说反了，反正就是不会写代码的人做出来难看，会写代码的也经常被配色、布局、字体折磨到崩溃。Flint 解决的就是这个痛点。",
      "start": 486.912,
      "duration": 25.595,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_046_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_046_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哈，你自己都绕进去了。那它到底怎么解决？",
      "start": 512.94,
      "duration": 4.223,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_047_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_047_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，Flint 用的是极简的描述规范。你只要告诉它\"我要一张柱状图，数据是 A、B、C、D，主题是科技感，配色用蓝灰渐变\"，它就能给你生成一张设计感拉满的图。",
      "start": 517.57,
      "duration": 15.432,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_048_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_048_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这不就是把设计师的工作给 AI 干了嘛！",
      "start": 533.472,
      "duration": 3.57,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_049_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_049_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，但它的厉害之处不只是生成图，而是把\"可视化\"变成了一种声明式语言。你不用关心图表怎么画、坐标系怎么摆、数据怎么映射，你只需要说你要什么。背后全是 AI 帮你做。",
      "start": 537.443,
      "duration": 13.908,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_050_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_050_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这太适合我这种审美灾难的人了。我跟你说，我以前做的图表，领导看了都摇头。",
